{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00916","headline":"横吹曲辞 陇头吟 · 翁绶","name":"横吹曲辞 陇头吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陇水潺湲陇树黄，征人陇上尽思乡。\n马嘶斜日朔风急，雁过寒云边思长。\n残月出林明劒戟，平沙隔水见牛羊。\n横行俱足封侯者，谁斩楼兰献未央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁绶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}